# Freshservice create

## Gate

Ordinary coding stays **ticketless**. Create only when the user clearly says
to file a Freshservice / ITSM ticket (incident, service request, problem,
change). “Fix X” alone does **not** authorize create.

## Create-only default

“File a Freshservice ticket” authorizes **create only**. Put scope into the
description (`freshservice-ticket`) and **stop**. Do not implement code unless
the user added an explicit second verb.

## Defaults (never invent)

1. Workspace / domain — configured or named only.
2. Group, requester, category, priority — configured or named; else omit or
   use the host default the operator already set.
3. Prefer MCP create tools when ready.

Ambiguity → **do not create**.
